    "Name": "Assassin ASN-SB",
    "Details": "Supposedly the custom Assassin that Dale Sandstrom piloted, this DarkDeath is built around a 280-rated XL engine on endo steel chassis, and is armed with an AC/2 in the right arm, twin LRM-5s in right torso, and a pair of medium lasers split between head and left torso. Retaining the ASN-21's seven jump jets, that variant's single heat sinks are also upgraded to double strength versions. Though carrying only a single ton of autocannon and LRM reloads limits it field endurance, DarkDeath mounts a Guardian ECM suite to help ensure the fight is on its terms.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.04</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_assassin"
  },
